    <section>
      <title>Self Check</title>
      <para>Which point is a solution to the line graphed below?</para>
      <figure class="unnumbered">  
      <media alt="">
            <image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/Algebra-1_01_07_07_01.png"/>
